### Pay
# @name Pay
# [disabled form field] coupon=X
POST {{base}}/pay
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Basic merchant {{secret_orders_basic_password}}

amount=12.50&note=a%20%26%20b%20%3D%20c

### Search
# @name Search
GET {{base}}/search?q=a%20b&page=2

### Upload
# @name Upload
POST {{base}}/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ApiClientImport

------ApiClientImport
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Quarterly
------ApiClientImport
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="report"; filename="report.csv"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./data/report.csv
------ApiClientImport
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="other"; filename="secret.csv"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< C:\Users\me\secret.csv
------ApiClientImport--
